#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-fixed-hsi-s0-20261018/docs/design/provider-assemblies.md:1
msgid "Selected provider assembly gate"
msgstr "选定提供者装配门禁"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-fixed-hsi-s0-20261018/docs/design/provider-assemblies.md:3
msgid ""
"The maintained gate links explicitly authored software fixtures through "
"their existing CMake projects. TOML and the sole configuration resolver "
"select the exact part, Board package, backend, routes, modes and budgets. "
"The gate does not rewrite a backend, create a provider registry, select "
"source targets or infer physical Board wiring."
msgstr ""
"维护中的门禁通过既有 CMake 工程链接显式编写的软件夹具。TOML 与唯一配置解析器选择精确料号、Board "
"包、后端、路由、模式及预算。门禁不改写后端、不建立提供者注册表、不选择源码目标，也不推断物理 Board 接线。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-fixed-hsi-s0-20261018/docs/design/provider-assemblies.md:54
msgid ""
"The output directory must be absent. Existing evidence, symlink destinations"
" and source directories are refused. Every actual command records its argv, "
"working directory, timestamps, return code and original stdout/stderr bytes."
" Missing tools, nonzero exits, timeouts and background artifact writers fail"
" the matrix and preserve its failed report. An empty or duplicate matrix "
"cannot count as successful work."
msgstr ""
"输出目录必须不存在。既有证据、符号链接目标和源码目录均拒绝。每条真实命令记录 argv、工作目录、时间戳、返回码和原始 stdout/stderr "
"字节。缺失工具、非零退出、超时或后台产物写入者使矩阵失败并保留失败报告。空矩阵或重复矩阵不能算成功工作。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-fixed-hsi-s0-20261018/docs/design/provider-assemblies.md:61
msgid ""
"After each real build, the gate requires exactly one firmware ELF and one "
"completed generated bundle. It compares the built canonical configuration "
"digest against the original resolved authored input, rechecks every declared"
" input, and recomputes memory allocation using the existing ELF resource "
"tool. The original post-link report must match the recomputation. Flash LOAD"
" bytes, Flash footprint, each physical RAM domain, MSP and heap retain their"
" existing budget semantics."
msgstr ""
"每次真实构建后，门禁要求恰好一个固件 ELF 与一个完整生成包。它比较已构建的规范配置摘要与原始作者输入解析结果，复核全部声明输入，并使用既有 ELF "
"资源工具重新计算内存分配。原始链接后报告须与重算相符。Flash LOAD 字节、Flash 占用、各物理 RAM 域、MSP 和 heap "
"保持既有预算语义。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-fixed-hsi-s0-20261018/docs/design/provider-assemblies.md:69
msgid ""
"For selected I/O, the existing retention tool independently follows actual "
"face pointers, concrete operations tables and every non-NULL method in ELF "
"LOAD bytes. Its post-link report must match the recomputation. A "
"deliberately empty fixture instead proves zero authored controllers/devices,"
" zero generated face declarations and absence of concrete I/O provider "
"tables and faces from the actual ELF. This is an executed empty-selection GC"
" check, not a skipped retention check or a claim that all unrelated runtime "
"code is absent."
msgstr ""
"选定 I/O 的既有保留检查工具独立追踪实际接口面指针、具体方法表及 ELF LOAD 中每个非 NULL "
"方法。链接后报告须与重算相符。刻意为空的夹具则证明零作者控制器／器件、零生成接口声明，且真实 ELF 不含具体 I/O "
"提供者表与接口面。这是实际执行的空选择 GC 检查，不是跳过保留检查，也不声称所有无关运行时代码都不存在。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-fixed-hsi-s0-20261018/docs/design/provider-assemblies.md:88
msgid ""
"`report.json` records `selected_provider_assembly_matrix`, actual fixture "
"and command counts, source identities, tool identities, per-fixture "
"configuration digests, ELF/BIN/map/bundle/report identities, RAM domains and"
" retained methods. All successful fixtures must pass; there is no skipped-"
"pass result. CI owns its explicit fixture list and uploads original commands"
" and artifacts alongside the report."
msgstr ""
"`report.json` 记录 "
"`selected_provider_assembly_matrix`、真实夹具／命令数量、源码身份、工具身份、各夹具配置摘要、ELF/BIN/map/bundle/report"
" 身份、RAM 域和保留方法。全部成功夹具均须通过，没有跳过即通过的结果。CI 持有显式夹具列表，并与报告一同上传原始命令及产物。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-fixed-hsi-s0-20261018/docs/design/provider-assemblies.md:95
msgid ""
"This gate establishes software graph, compile/link, budget and selected "
"provider retention evidence. It does not execute MCU startup, interrupts, "
"DMA, USB enumeration, Ethernet traffic, timer waveforms or electrical "
"controls. Physical status remains `not_executed`; cycles and latency remain "
"`not_measured`. Model tests and eventual HIL qualification are separate "
"scopes."
msgstr ""
"本门禁建立软件图、编译／链接、预算及所选提供者保留证据，不执行 MCU 启动、中断、DMA、USB 枚举、Ethernet 流量、timer "
"波形或电气控制。物理状态保持 `not_executed`，周期和延迟保持 `not_measured`。模型测试与后续 HIL 资格范围独立。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-fixed-hsi-s0-20261018/docs/design/provider-assemblies.md:101
msgid "Tool regression tests run with:"
msgstr "工具回归测试命令："

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-fixed-hsi-s0-20261018/docs/design/provider-assemblies.md:17
msgid ""
"Repeat `--fixture` for a reviewed list of authored TOMLs. Without "
"`--project`, each TOML must remain in `tests/contracts` with its maintained "
"sibling `CMakeLists.txt`. An explicit `--project` instead binds the whole "
"invocation to one existing CMake project under the checkout's "
"`tests/contracts`; its TOMLs may be owned contract fixtures or canonical "
"schema-2 assemblies directly in `tools/configure/assemblies`. Each selection"
" must resolve to an MCU configuration. The gate does not discover a project "
"from the family or silently change modes."
msgstr ""
"对经审查的 TOML 列表重复传入 `--fixture`。未指定 `--project` 时，每份 TOML 仍须位于 "
"`tests/contracts`，并具有维护中的同目录 `CMakeLists.txt`。显式 `--project` 将整次调用绑定到当前 "
"checkout 的 `tests/contracts` 下一个既有 CMake 工程；TOML 可以是该仓库的合同夹具，或直接位于 "
"`tools/configure/assemblies` 的规范 schema-2 装配。每个选择都必须解析为 MCU "
"配置。门禁不根据系列自动发现工程，也不静默切换模式。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-fixed-hsi-s0-20261018/docs/design/provider-assemblies.md:25
msgid ""
"For the three public H743 SPI4 DMA assemblies, run the existing H743 project"
" from the repository root with the maintained ARM compiler on `PATH`:"
msgstr "对于三个公开的 H743 SPI4 DMA 装配，在仓库根目录执行既有 H743 工程，并确保维护中的 ARM 编译器位于 `PATH`："

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-fixed-hsi-s0-20261018/docs/design/provider-assemblies.md:39
msgid ""
"The output must be fresh; success requires every selected firmware build, "
"resource report and retained provider method to pass. The command links ARM "
"software and preserves its report and raw output; it does not execute the "
"MCU. The complete H743 provider stage selects the existing 26 contract "
"assemblies plus these three canonical assemblies through the same project. A"
" narrow three-fixture invocation is not the complete 29-fixture stage."
msgstr ""
"输出路径必须全新；每个选定固件构建、资源报告和保留的 provider 方法均须通过。命令链接 ARM 软件并保存报告及原始输出，不执行 MCU。完整 "
"H743 provider 阶段通过同一工程选择既有 26 份合同装配和这三份规范装配。仅运行三份夹具不等于完成全部 29 份夹具的阶段。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-fixed-hsi-s0-20261018/docs/design/provider-assemblies.md:46
msgid ""
"The optional family assertion compares the actual resolver result. Different"
" backends require distinct maintained authored TOMLs; there is no "
"independent OS override. CMake builds the selected project's default target "
"graph using `NEXUS_SOURCE_ROOT` and `NEXUS_ASSEMBLY_FILE`. Native "
"selections, outside or symlinked projects, duplicate fixtures and repeated "
"project selection are refused. The selected source root must own the "
"executed gate and its imported tools; tools from another checkout are "
"refused."
msgstr ""
"可选的系列断言对照实际解析结果。不同后端必须具有分别维护的 TOML；不存在独立 OS 覆盖项。CMake 使用 `NEXUS_SOURCE_ROOT`"
" 和 `NEXUS_ASSEMBLY_FILE` 构建所选工程的默认目标图。Native "
"选择、仓库外工程、符号链接工程、重复夹具和重复指定工程均被拒绝。选定源码根目录必须拥有实际执行的门禁及其导入工具；其他 checkout 的工具被拒绝。"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-h743-fixed-hsi-s0-20261018/docs/design/provider-assemblies.md:77
msgid ""
"The actual compiler database and Ninja dependency log bind compiled sources,"
" generated headers, selected vendor headers and compiler-provided headers to"
" file identities. Maintained graph/configuration sources and selected locked"
" SDK input bytes are snapshotted before execution and verified afterward. "
"The explicit project, its CMake inputs and the selected authored assemblies "
"are part of that snapshot. Changing the project's source or any declared "
"assembly invalidates the evidence. The matrix rejects source, Git revision, "
"tool or artifact changes. A dirty checkout may provide explicitly identified"
" development evidence; it cannot qualify a clean release candidate through "
"this gate alone."
msgstr ""
"实际编译数据库和 Ninja 依赖日志将编译源码、生成头、选定厂商头及编译器提供的头绑定到文件身份。维护中的图／配置源码及选定的锁定 SDK "
"输入字节在执行前建立快照，并在执行后复核。显式工程、它的 CMake "
"输入和所选装配均属于该快照。工程源码或任何声明装配发生变化都会使证据失效。矩阵拒绝源码、Git 版本、工具或产物变化。dirty checkout "
"可以提供身份明确的开发证据，但仅此门禁不能赋予 clean 发布候选资格。"

